.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt KUBE-DEMO-IMAGE 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm kube-demo-image
.Nd build the demo storefront's image here and put it on every node of the cluster
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar tag
.Nm
.Fl h | -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The demo's application image is built on this machine, not pulled from a
registry, so the demo runs with the network unplugged.
.Nm :
.Bl -enum -compact
.It
compiles the application's Python, and checks its JavaScript's syntax in
a Node container when that image is present \(em saying the check was
skipped when it is not;
.It
builds
.Ql localhost/kldload-demo: Ns Ar tag
with
.Xr podman 1 ,
default tag
.Ql 1.0.0 ,
and imports the application inside the built image, which catches what
compiling cannot;
.It
saves it as one OCI archive and copies it to every node over ssh,
importing it into containerd's
.Ql k8s.io
namespace, where the kubelet looks, on all nodes at once;
.It
asks each node whether it has the image, and names every node that does
not.
.El
.Pp
The demo's chart asks for the image with
.Ql imagePullPolicy: Never ,
so a node without it fails at once rather than trying a registry.
It runs itself under
.Xr sudo 8 .
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print the header comment and exit 0.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ev DEMO_DIR
Default
.Pa /usr/local/share/kldload/demo .
.It Ev KUBECONFIG
Default
.Pa /root/.kube/config .
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0 when every node has the image; 1 on a failure, named; 2 when
.Ar tag
is not an image tag.
.Sh EXAMPLES
On a kldload desktop on 2026-09-30, with this release's
.Nm
first on the path:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ kube-demo-image '1.0'\e''; id'
[demo-image] not an image tag: 1.0'; id
# (exited 2)
.Ed
.Pp
Building; not run for this page, since there was no cluster:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
# kube-demo-image 1.0.1
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr podman 1 ,
.Xr ctr 8 ,
.Xr kube-demo 8 ,
.Xr kube-demo-publish 8
.Sh HISTORY
The demo pulled its application from Docker Hub until those tags were
removed upstream and every new install's demo broke.
On 2026-09-30, writing this page: the tag went unchecked into a command
every node runs as root.
